# [OPSAWG](../wg/opsawg.html)

## Summary

The Operations and Management Area Working Group (OPSAWG) met at IETF 127. The session was chaired by Joe Clarke, with co-chair Benoît Claise participating remotely. The meeting covered working group administration, status updates on active documents, and eleven technical presentations spanning YANG data models, IPFIX extensions, data provenance, and TACACS+ protocol extensions. 

Key outcomes included progressing working group documents, discussing structural and venue questions for IPFIX extensions, and taking formal adoption/feedback polls.

