## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-opsawg-ipfix-ecn`:** Authors will remove proposed octet/packet counters based on feedback and poll results, refine Q2 (ACE scope) on the mailing list, and prepare version -02.
2. **`draft-ietf-opsawg-scheduling-oam-tests`:** Authors will update priority text from normative requirements to operational guidance and post an updated revision before WGLC.
3. **`draft-heller-opsawg-ordered-ie-ipfix`:** Following strong poll support in the meeting (12 Yes, 0 No), chairs will issue a formal Working Group Adoption call on the mailing list.
4. **`draft-gash-opsawg-tacacs-ssh-pubkey`:** Chairs will issue a Working Group Adoption call on the mailing list for the current version.
5. **AD / Chair Action:** ADs (Mahesh Jethanandani) and Chairs will coordinate venue placement and charter scope for technology-specific IPFIX drafts (`draft-wang-opsawg-ipfix-igp-algo`, `draft-yujia-opsawg-ipfix-flowspec`), process work (`draft-ietf-opsawg-veloce-yang`), and YANG normalization (`draft-garcia-opsawg-yang-normalization`).

